Claude HYSA

Quick flag before the numbers: Claude doesn't have a fixed leaderboard for HYSAs. What gets named depends on the exact phrasing, whether search fires, and which aggregator pages come back that day. So there's no single authoritative "rank on Claude." What I can do is reconstruct it from the sources Claude actually pulls (Bankrate, NerdWallet, Motley Fool, Money, WalletHub, SmartAsset, Forbes) plus current APYs — that's a decent proxy for AI visibility.

The ranking splits sharply depending on which query you mean.

**A. "Best HYSA rate right now" (rate-led query)**

| Rank | Bank | APY (Aug/Sep 2026) | Why it ranks there |
|---|---|---|---|
| 1 | Axos | up to 4.21% | Axos ONE bundles checking + savings, no monthly fees, no minimums, top rate unlocked at higher deposit thresholds — appears at or near #1 on most lists |
| 2 | Newtek | ~4.20–4.35% | Won NerdWallet's 2026 best savings account award; SwitchWize has it leading at 4.20%, no minimum deposit |
